    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h1>PLEASE WISHLIST THE GAME AND FOLLOW TO SUPPORT US</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=591 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/ab1bc89c432df24d48454318e36820a3.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backyard Digger is a relaxing game about digging in your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what lies beneath your lawn \u2014 it might be more than just dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine valuable metals, uncover hidden treasures, and stumble upon abandoned mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell everything you find and upgrade your tools to dig deeper and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangers like falling rocks, extreme heat, and the risk of crashing as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the very bottom and uncover the unknown secrets hidden in Backyard Digger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience immersive, physics-based soil destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover hundreds of meters of hidden depths</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And beware of what you'll find...</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Backyard Digger is a relaxing game about digging in your backyard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover what lies beneath your lawn \u2014 it might be more than just dirt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine valuable metals, uncover hidden treasures, and stumble upon abandoned mines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sell everything you find and upgrade your tools to dig deeper and more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid dangers like falling rocks, extreme heat, and the risk of crashing as you descend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the very bottom and uncover the unknown secrets hidden in Backyard Digger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience immersive, physics-based soil destruction</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/73a101f52ad5ac3a54499aec53d31470.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover hundreds of meters of hidden depths</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/d529557529535c157fbd868283fb2962.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And beware of what you'll find...</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.poster.avif?t=1749118892\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.webm?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3264640/extras/8459dd6719a401a84f7b2014a318ba3b.mp4?t=1749118892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
